{
  "page": 524,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4750,
      "text": "Maka apakah ini sihir? Ataukah kamu tidak melihat?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4751,
      "text": "Masuklah ke dalamnya (rasakanlah panas apinya); baik kamu bersabar atau tidak, sama saja bagimu; sesungguhnya kamu hanya diberi balasan atas apa yang telah kamu kerjakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4752,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang bertakwa berada dalam surga dan kenikmatan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4753,
      "text": "Mereka bersuka ria dengan apa yang diberikan Tuhan kepada mereka; dan Tuhan memelihara mereka dari azab neraka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4754,
      "text": "(Dikatakan kepada mereka), \"Makan dan minumlah dengan rasa nikmat sebagai balasan dari apa yang telah kamu kerjakan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4755,
      "text": "Mereka bersandar di atas dipan-dipan yang tersusun, dan Kami berikan kepada mereka pasangan bidadari yang bermata indah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4756,
      "text": "Dan orang-orang yang beriman, beserta anak cucu mereka yang mengikuti mereka dalam keimanan, Kami pertemukan mereka dengan anak cucu mereka (di dalam surga), dan Kami tidak mengurangi sedikit pun pahala amal (kebajikan) mereka. Setiap orang terikat dengan apa yang dikerjakannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4757,
      "text": "Dan Kami berikan kepada mereka tambahan berupa buah-buahan dan daging dari segala jenis yang mereka ingini.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4758,
      "text": "(Di dalam surga itu) mereka saling mengulurkan gelas yang isinya tidak (menimbulkan) ucapan sia-sia ataupun perbuatan dosa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4759,
      "text": "Dan di sekitar mereka ada anak-anak muda yang berkeliling untuk (melayani) mereka, seakan-akan mereka itu mutiara yang tersimpan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4760,
      "text": "Dan sebagian mereka berhadap-hadapan satu sama lain saling bertegur sapa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4761,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Sesungguhnya kami dahulu, sewaktu berada di tengah-tengah keluarga kami merasa takut (akan diazab).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4762,
      "text": "Maka Allah memberikan karunia kepada kami dan memelihara kami dari azab neraka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4763,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya kami menyembah-Nya sejak dahulu. Dialah Yang Maha Melimpahkan Kebaikan, Maha Penyayang.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4764,
      "text": "Maka peringatkanlah, karena dengan nikmat Tuhanmu engkau (Muhammad) bukanlah seorang tukang tenung dan bukan pula orang gila.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4765,
      "text": "Bahkan mereka berkata, \"Dia adalah seorang penyair yang kami tunggu-tunggu kecelakaan menimpanya.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4766,
      "text": "Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Tunggulah! Sesungguhnya aku pun termasuk orang yang sedang menunggu bersama kamu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
